   "locator": "abstract"
  },
  "implication_for_the_viewer": "Checking gliding at a fixed 10 m/s makes gliding look possible at hatching; that is an artefact. Required airspeed falls with size (lower wing loading), so what limits a small fish is reaching and holding that airspeed, for which we have no juvenile data. trajectory.mjs reports v_min(SL) as a derived, assumption-laden number, not a glide/no-glide verdict."
